        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, waan isani worra Israelitini jed'u, Anini isani namu woma inni tahuni qora. Tanaafi ch'ubbu tolchitani tana ch'ufa iraa deebia; ch'ubbuuni teesani tunini isani imballeesini ufi eegad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hameenna isani tolchitani kana ch'ufa yaala baha, qalbiifi garaa hareesa horad'a. Isani worri Israeli, maafi badu feetani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, nama tokole ka duu infed'u, ch'ubbu teesani iraa deebia, jireennati baha, jed'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
